### Run these in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (free).
### Start the server first (npm run seed && npm start), then send the requests in order.

@host = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Sign in as a student, then paste the token below
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "aarav@campus.test", "password": "Demo@12345" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search labs that are free on a given range (change the dates to the future)
GET {{host}}/resources?type=lab&start=2026-11-10T09:00:00Z&end=2026-11-10T10:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a booking (change the dates to the future)
# @name booking
POST {{host}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resource_id": 2,
  "start_time": "2026-11-10T09:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z",
  "purpose": "Group study"
}

### The same slot again returns 409 booking_conflict
POST {{host}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resource_id": 2,
  "start_time": "2026-11-10T09:30:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-11-10T10:30:00Z",
  "purpose": "Overlapping request"
}

### Back-to-back slot is allowed
POST {{host}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resource_id": 2,
  "start_time": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-11-10T11:00:00Z",
  "purpose": "Next session"
}

### My upcoming bookings
GET {{host}}/bookings?upcoming=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel (repeat it: the second call also returns 200)
POST {{host}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.booking.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A student trying an admin action returns 403
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sign in as admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@campus.test", "password": "Demo@12345" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### All pending requests
GET {{host}}/bookings?scope=all&status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve one
POST {{host}}/bookings/2/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reject one with a reason
POST {{host}}/bookings/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Room is reserved for an exam" }

### Add a resource
POST {{host}}/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Seminar Hall B", "type": "room", "location": "Administrative Block", "capacity": 100, "requires_approval": true }
